<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for the <ansi fg="command">trash</ansi> command.</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">trash</ansi> command destroys an item you carry, for good.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

::keep
  <ansi fg="command">trash stick</ansi>
::
  This would destroy a stick if you had it in your backpack.

Find out more about referring to items by name by typing <ansi fg="command">help item-names</ansi>.
